Package: heatwave3
Version: 1.4.0
Title: Detect Heatwaves and Cold-Spells in Gridded Data
Description: Detect marine heatwaves (MHWs) and cold-spells (MCS) directly on gridded
    'NetCDF' data using the definition of Hobday et al. (2016)
    <doi:10.1016/j.pocean.2015.12.014> and the categories of Hobday et al.
    (2018) <doi:10.5670/oceanog.2018.205>. Implements climatology calculation,
    event detection, exceedance analysis, event categorisation, blob detection,
    and visualisation. All core algorithms are written in multi-threaded C++
    for high performance on large datasets.
Type: Package
